<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - COMMERCIAL BANKSHARES.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - COMMERCIAL BANKSHARES.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Josepthal, Lyon &amp; Ross analyst Grank Barkocy said he reiterated a buy on Commercial Bankshares Inc</p>
<p>--  Price target on fundamentals $18/shr, on takeover potential $22/shr</p>
<p>-- Company raised dividend last week to $0.08 quarterly, a 60 percent increase</p>
<p>-- Q1 1997 earnings seen at $0.31/shr, year at $1.25</p>
<p>-- 1998 earnings projected at $1.50/shr</p>
<p>-- Commercial Bankshares unchanged at 15-3/8 in early trade</p>
</text>
